{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44535","headline":"诗三百三首 二三二 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二三二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我见凡愚人，多畜资财谷。\n饮酒食生命，谓言我富足。\n莫知地狱深，唯求上天福。\n罪业如毘富，岂得免灾毒。\n财主忽然死，争共当头哭。\n供僧读文疏，空是鬼神禄。\n福田一个无，虚设一羣秃。\n不如早觉悟，莫作黑暗狱。\n狂风不动树，心真无罪福。\n寄语冗冗人，叮咛再三读。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}